# Agent session scratch — never commit. Exception: .claude/agents/ holds versioned,
# project-scoped agent definitions (docs/agents/dev-tracks.md references them) — those travel
# with the repo like any other doc, not local session state.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
.scratch/
